<title>FRANCE: Britain's Prince Charles to visit rough Paris areas.</title>
<headline>Britain's Prince Charles to visit rough Paris areas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Prince Charles will visit several rough Paris suburbs next Thursday with French junior minister for Urban Affairs and Integration Eric Raoult, the minister's office said .</p>
<p>The heir to the British throne heads a foundation entitled said.</p>
